<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-017" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:position" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:position:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王濬沖</persName>為尚書令，著公服，乘軺車，經<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:position:m0017" ref="1eo_0xn_30q">黃公</persName>酒壚下過，</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:speech" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">顧謂後車客：「吾昔與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:speech:m0010" ref="6fg_r6l_5a5">嵇叔夜</persName>、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:speech:m0014" ref="6d5_075_29b">阮嗣宗</persName>共酣飲於此壚，竹林之遊，亦預其末。自<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:speech:m0035" ref="6fg_r6l_5a5">嵇生</persName>夭、<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:speech:m0039" ref="6d5_075_29b">阮公</persName>亡以來，便為時所羈紲。今日視此雖近，邈若山河。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:zhulin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note">俗傳若此。潁川<rs id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:zhulin:u0007" type="unresolved">庾爰之</rs>嘗以問其伯<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:zhulin:m0015" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_B">文康</persName>，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-017-jin043-wangrong:zhulin:m0018" ref="4qr_wrk_3vd_B">文康</persName>云：『中朝所不聞，江左忽有此論，皆好事者為之也。』</p>
</text>
